  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "New stems in the past",
     "texto": [
      "**dar** → **dei** (I gave), **dizer** → **disse** (I said), **vir** → **vim** (I came), **ver** → **vi** (I saw), **pôr** → **pus** (I put).",
      "They are not the same forms as in the present: **digo** (present) and **disse** (past) are different in tense."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The endings",
     "texto": [
      "The endings resemble the regular ones: **-ste** (you), **-u** (he or she), **-mos** (we), **-ram** (they).",
      "Watch out: **vim** (I came) and **vieste** (you came) come from **vir**, and **vi** (I saw) and **viste** (you saw) from **ver**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
